🔷 KNN Classifier (Classification)
🧠 Kaam: Bataata hai ki cheez kis category mein aati hai.

📌 Example:
Tumhare paas kuch logon ka data hai – unka age aur salary, aur pata hai ki kaun product khareedta hai aur kaun nahi.

Ab agar koi naya aadmi aaye, toh KNN nearby (sabse paas ke) logon ko dekhega aur vote karega:

Agar 3 mein se 2 ne product khareeda hai → prediction: ye bhi khareedega (label = 1)

✅ Output: Yes/No, 0/1, Dog/Cat, etc.

🔷 KNN Regressor (Regression)
🧠 Kaam: Koi number value predict karta hai.

📌 Example:
Tumhare paas gharon ka data hai – size aur bedrooms, aur unka price.
Ab tum kisi naye ghar ka price predict karna chahte ho.

KNN nearby gharon ka price dekhega, unka average lega:

(80 lakh + 90 lakh) / 2 = 85 lakh → prediction

✅ Output: ₹85,00000, temperature, height, etc.